    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「あぁ、監察のひと……。先の一番隊組長の、いちかさんでしたっけ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「彼女が亡くなっちゃったから、その仕事を局長さん自ら代行してるんですね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-gambler",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-gambler_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-shinsengumi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-shinsengumi_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「そゆこと。イチも可哀想に、若い身空で命を散らすとは……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-gambler",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-gambler_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「けっこう優秀な子だったからね～、穴埋めもなかなか大変だわさ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-gambler",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-gambler_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「あんたを一番隊組長に抜擢したのも、殉職したイチの代理ってだけだから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「ちゃんと働かないと降格して下っ端にするよ～、こんなところで油売ってないでさ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-gambler",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-gambler_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
