    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-shinsengumi_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「う～ん。あんたが真面目にがんばってるのは知ってるよ～う、無理だけはしないでね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「あんまり、身体が丈夫じゃないんだから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-gambler",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-gambler_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「生きてこそ浮かぶ瀬もあれ。人生、苦もありゃ楽もあるよ～う♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-gambler",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-gambler_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「ともあれ。そんな感じで、あたしは情報収集のために遊び歩いてるんだけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「あの子……マシロっていうんだけど、遊廓で一番人気の花魁でね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「遊廓には情報と銭が集まる、あの子と仲良くなってれば得られるものは計り知れない。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-gambler",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-gambler_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「そう思ってコナかけたら、どうも惚れられちゃったらしくてね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「あたし、女だよってちゃんと説明したんだけど。『じゃあ友達になろう！』ってね……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「本気であたしを心配してるっていうか、仲良くなりたいみたい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-gambler",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-gambler_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「すっごい、良い子なんだよね～。あたしもお仕事じゃなくて、個人的に出会いたかったにゃあ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-gambler",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-gambler_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「でも。だからこそ、マシロを新撰組がらみのゴタゴタに巻きこみたくない。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「幸せになってほしいわさ、あの子にはその権利がある」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「つらいこと、苦しいことが『いっぱい』あって……。でも、マシロはそれを笑顔で乗り越えてきたの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「それだけじゃなくて、ひとに優しくして元気にしてあげてる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-gambler",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-gambler_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「尊敬するわさ。だからね、あの子を血なまぐさい修羅場に引きずりこみたくない」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-gambler",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-gambler_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「これは、あんたにも言ってるんだよ～う。我らが新撰組の、一番隊組長ちゃん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
