    "expression": "old-shinsengumi_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「にゃはは。ごめんね、お説教みたいになっちゃった。とりあえず、暇ならマシロをうまく追っ払っといて？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-gambler",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-gambler_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「こんな城下町を花魁が走り回ってたら、騒ぎになっちゃうから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-gambler",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-gambler_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「町の風紀を守るのが、本来の新撰組のお役目だよね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-gambler",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-gambler_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
